WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.172 --> 00:00:09.075
Do you like being tickled?

00:00:09.075 --> 00:00:11.311
First, you laugh a lot.

00:00:11.311 --> 00:00:14.180
It’s uncontrollable but funny. 

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:16.683
Then you laugh so hard

00:00:16.683 --> 00:00:18.451
that your abs hurt

00:00:18.451 --> 00:00:21.454
(Frantically laughing)

00:00:21.454 --> 00:00:22.389
Okay, stop.

00:00:22.389 --> 00:00:24.457
But what if

00:00:24.457 --> 00:00:26.459
the tickling doesn't stop

00:00:26.459 --> 00:00:28.995
for 24 hours?

00:00:28.995 --> 00:00:32.999
Could you be tickled to death?

00:00:39.372 --> 00:00:41.808
There are two types of tickling.

00:00:41.808 --> 00:00:43.410
The most common is

00:00:45.211 --> 00:00:46.813
That's when someone touches

00:00:46.813 --> 00:00:48.715
parts of your body repeatedly,

00:00:48.715 --> 00:00:50.417
 causing you to laugh.

00:00:50.417 --> 00:00:52.552
The other type of tickling is

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:57.090
That's where a light touch on your skin

00:00:57.090 --> 00:00:59.426
causes a tickling sensation

00:00:59.426 --> 00:01:01.227
but not laughter.

00:01:01.227 --> 00:01:03.496
The most sensitive areas

00:01:03.496 --> 00:01:04.697
are your stomach,

00:01:04.697 --> 00:01:05.732
sides,

00:01:05.732 --> 00:01:06.699
armpits,

00:01:06.699 --> 00:01:07.667
feet,

00:01:07.667 --> 00:01:09.702
 and neck.

00:01:09.702 --> 00:01:12.739
And the reason you can’t tickle yourself,

00:01:12.739 --> 00:01:15.442
it's that there is no element of surprise.

00:01:15.442 --> 00:01:16.910
Your brain knows

00:01:16.910 --> 00:01:18.745
that the sensation is coming.

00:01:18.745 --> 00:01:21.414
But research has shown

00:01:21.414 --> 00:01:23.383
that those with schizophrenia

00:01:23.383 --> 00:01:25.185
can tickle themselves

00:01:25.185 --> 00:01:27.887
because their brain can’t differentiate

00:01:27.887 --> 00:01:29.255
between self-generated

00:01:29.255 --> 00:01:32.225
and externally generated touches.

00:01:32.225 --> 00:01:35.161
So, how much tickling

00:01:35.161 --> 00:01:37.097
could the human body handle?

00:01:39.833 --> 00:01:42.068
"Don't do that, it tickles ok!"

00:01:42.068 --> 00:01:44.604
You tried to avoid it,

00:01:44.604 --> 00:01:46.973
but you’re now being tickled.

00:01:46.973 --> 00:01:49.542
Even the thought of it makes you giggle.

00:01:49.542 --> 00:01:51.311
You know that feeling.

00:01:51.311 --> 00:01:53.346
Sometimes you’re laughing,

00:01:53.346 --> 00:01:54.514
but it doesn’t mean

00:01:54.514 --> 00:01:56.249
that you are enjoying it.

00:01:56.249 --> 00:01:57.317
Scientists from

00:01:57.317 --> 00:01:58.852
the University of California

00:01:58.852 --> 00:02:01.187
found that tickling doesn’t create

00:02:01.187 --> 00:02:02.789
the same laughter someone

00:02:02.789 --> 00:02:04.491
gets from a funny joke.

00:02:04.491 --> 00:02:06.759
It’s just an outward illusion.

00:02:08.761 --> 00:02:10.797
"Ohh, that tickles!"

00:02:10.797 --> 00:02:12.532
Being tickled stimulates

00:02:12.532 --> 00:02:14.167
your hypothalamus,

00:02:14.167 --> 00:02:15.502
the part of your brain

00:02:15.502 --> 00:02:18.638
that controls your emotional reactions.

00:02:18.638 --> 00:02:19.906
It’s also where

00:02:19.906 --> 00:02:22.275
the physiological reaction to an attack

00:02:22.275 --> 00:02:24.410
or a threat is activated.

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:27.213
So when you laugh from being tickled,

00:02:27.213 --> 00:02:28.515
you have an automatic

00:02:28.515 --> 00:02:30.216
emotional response.

00:02:30.216 --> 00:02:33.019
But the body movements you make

00:02:33.019 --> 00:02:35.155
mimic those of individuals

00:02:35.155 --> 00:02:36.823
in severe pain.

00:02:36.823 --> 00:02:38.658
A prolonged tickle

00:02:38.658 --> 00:02:41.094
would be extremely unpleasant.

00:02:41.094 --> 00:02:43.062
So, you might want to stop at this point.

00:02:45.064 --> 00:02:48.334
After one hour of non-stop giggles,

00:02:48.334 --> 00:02:51.471
your core would be extremely sore.

00:02:51.471 --> 00:02:53.740
It would be the best workout of your life

00:02:53.740 --> 00:02:56.176
and the nastiest one.

00:02:56.176 --> 00:02:58.611
They say laughter is the best medicine.

00:02:58.611 --> 00:02:59.879
But, in this case,

00:02:59.879 --> 00:03:01.381
I beg to differ.

00:03:03.383 --> 00:03:04.717
Okay, you've been tickled

00:03:04.717 --> 00:03:06.486
for 10 hours now.

00:03:06.486 --> 00:03:08.988
It's pure torture.

00:03:08.988 --> 00:03:10.223
As a matter of fact,

00:03:10.223 --> 00:03:12.125
tickling has been used

00:03:12.125 --> 00:03:14.160
in sinister ways in the past.

00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:16.429
During the Han Dynasty, 

00:03:16.429 --> 00:03:19.065
in the 3rd century B.C.E.,

00:03:19.065 --> 00:03:21.601
 the Chinese used it as torture

00:03:21.601 --> 00:03:24.003
because the victim would suffer,

00:03:24.003 --> 00:03:26.206
but it didn’t leave any marks.

00:03:26.206 --> 00:03:28.942
Sorry, but this last stretch

00:03:28.942 --> 00:03:30.777
will not be pleasant.

00:03:32.779 --> 00:03:34.981
The constant laughter you’ve had

00:03:34.981 --> 00:03:37.050
for 15 hours

00:03:37.050 --> 00:03:39.519
could lead you to pass out.

00:03:39.519 --> 00:03:41.521
Fainting is caused

00:03:41.521 --> 00:03:43.823
by a temporary drop in blood pressure.

00:03:43.823 --> 00:03:45.258
Your brain doesn't get

00:03:45.258 --> 00:03:46.693
the blood flow it needs,

00:03:46.693 --> 00:03:48.561
and you lose consciousness.

00:03:48.561 --> 00:03:50.797
It could cause you both mental

00:03:50.797 --> 00:03:52.432
and physical harm.

00:03:52.432 --> 00:03:53.633
So please,

00:03:53.633 --> 00:03:55.468
don't try this at home,

00:03:55.468 --> 00:03:57.937
with yourself or your friends.

00:03:59.939 --> 00:04:01.741
Okay, by the time you reach

00:04:01.741 --> 00:04:03.009
the end of this challenge,

00:04:03.009 --> 00:04:06.079
you’d have lost control of your body.

00:04:06.079 --> 00:04:07.580
You wouldn’t be able to regulate

00:04:07.580 --> 00:04:08.748
 your breathing

00:04:08.748 --> 00:04:11.117
and you would be very stressed.

00:04:11.117 --> 00:04:12.852
You could have asphyxia,

00:04:12.852 --> 00:04:14.587
a brain aneurysm

00:04:14.587 --> 00:04:16.689
or a heart attack.

00:04:16.689 --> 00:04:18.925
Yeah, so to answer your question,

00:04:18.925 --> 00:04:21.728
yes, you can be tickled to death.

00:04:21.728 --> 00:04:22.962
"Get me out of this now!"

00:04:22.962 --> 00:04:26.332
If tickling isn't your thing,

00:04:26.332 --> 00:04:28.234
well, how about dancing?

00:04:28.234 --> 00:04:29.636
Think you could twist

00:04:29.636 --> 00:04:31.571
and shake for 24 hours?

00:04:31.571 --> 00:04:33.940
 Alright then, let's party.

00:04:33.940 --> 00:04:36.976
We'll see what that challenge brings

00:04:36.976 --> 00:04:39.078
on another episode of

